56 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (The current IT procurement process lacks efficiency and automation, resulting in delays and manual effort, particularly when handling standard laptop orders. Standard laptop requests require configuration after approval, but manual task creation and assignment can lead to delays and oversight.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
