58 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (The project uses ServiceNow Flow Designer to automate the standard laptop procurement workflow. When a Standard Laptop request is submitted and approved, the flow automatically creates a Catalog Task, updates the task description, and assigns the task to the Hardware assignment group.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
